# Round 2 (2026-10-24, design consult fix H): stop publishing the
# workshop. outputDirectory stays "." (the generator, the api/
# functions and the cron all work from the repo root), so the private
# and working files are kept out of the deployment here instead.
# Named exception EXCEPTION-TR-R2-OUTPUT: the site/ output route was
# not taken because build_site.py, api/*.js and api/cron/wire.js all
# read and write repo-root paths; re-pointing them in this pass would
# risk a broken build. This ignore route is the extract's own fix H.
hidden_files/
*.md
!README.md
pipeline/
scripts/
tests/
skills/
# the published copies live under data/v1/ (app.js tries v1 first);
# the working store and its history stay unpublished
data/trends.json
data/velocity_history.json
# NOT ignored on purpose: static/v1/trends.flat.js is the destination
# of the /api/v1/trends.flat.js rewrite in vercel.json and a public
# API contract, so it stays published.
